OL,10,     Flies catch up with him. Levi is
OL,11,     Fimpatient with his recovery.
OL,12,G1900 GPs: Behind Closed Doors
OL,13,     FSchoolgirl Lily visits Dr Devin
OL,14,     FGray. Her mum is concerned she
OL,15,     Fcould have glandular fever.
OL,16,     FMorteza has a condition known as
OL,17,     Fspinal stenosis and his back pain
OL,18,     Fis getting worse.
