OL,5,G0000 Killer at the Crime Scene
OL,6,     FA university lecturer's murder,
OL,7,     Fstabbed to death in a park, marks
OL,8,     Fthe start of a killer's reign of
OL,9,     Fterror as more stabbings follow,
OL,10,     Fwith authorities scrambling to
OL,11,     Fkeep up.
OL,12,G0100 Cold Case Killers
OL,13,     FInvestigating the murders of Samo
OL,14,     FPaul and Tracey Turner which,
OL,15,     Fdespite similarities, are not
OL,16,     Finitially connected. But Chief
OL,17,     FConstable Mick Creedon believes
OL,18,     Fit's the work of one man.
