OL,5,G0200 Casualty 24/7: Every Second Counts
OL,6,     FAfter a quiet start to the day,
OL,7,     Fthe staff at Barnsley casualty
OL,8,     Ftreat John who has hit is head
OL,9,     Ffalling at home and seven month
OL,10,     Fold Elisa is treated in
OL,11,     Fpaediatrics.
OL,12,G0245 Skin A&E
OL,13,     FA forehead lump isn't what it
OL,14,     Fseems for Dr Magnus. Dr Emma
OL,15,     Fassists - or rather de-cysts - an
OL,16,     F80-year-old patient wanting to
OL,17,     Flook her best for her grandson's
OL,18,     Fwedding.
